::  modules/brushstroke/glow/fold-harness-console.glow -- Harness Console!
/-  compiler-shapes
/!  32768
|%
++  gate-harness-console-frame
  |=  [bytes=@ud hits=@ud turns=@ud]                    ::  <=256K & hits<=t
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  verified bytes
  ~|  'vantage-harness-console-frame-or-hits-breach'    ::  Glasswall frame
  ?>  &(lte(bytes 262144) gth(turns 0) lte(hits turns))
  bytes
--
